{{h1}}Discussion

{{h2}}General Guidance

- Clarify the problem, intended outcome, constraints, and acceptance criteria with the user.
- Explore options and trade-offs before proposing an approach.
- Do not modify production code or tests until the user and agent have aligned on the work to perform.
- Capture agreed requirements and decisions in the project’s planning artifacts when appropriate.

{{#workflow}}
{{h2}}Guide Workflow Add-in

If not already in discussion phase, change the workflow to DISCUSSION phase.

{{#args.0.value}}
Change the current issue to `{{args.0.value}}`, clear its plan and tracking fields, remove it from the queue if present, then send the updated `{{workflow.file}}` using {{tool_prefix}}send_file_content.
{{/args.0.value}}
{{^args.0.value}}
Keep the current issue, plan, and tracking, change the phase to discussion, then send the updated `{{workflow.file}}` using {{tool_prefix}}send_file_content.
{{/args.0.value}}
{{/workflow}}
